	(text "Board: 48.00 x 76.00 mm; corner radius 1.20 mm; six copper layers.\nFour M2 clearance holes, diameter 2.20 mm, NPTH.\nOriginal SCREW3 was outside the board edge and has been removed.\nUse the actual PCB hole coordinates for enclosure bosses; do not use source Gerber coordinates.\nKeep the ESP32 antenna area free of metal, battery foil and ground copper.\nThe PCB size fits within a 50 x 80 mm envelope, but does not establish final product thickness.\nAntenna clearance and connector overhangs must be verified against the final enclosure."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30 110 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "376bb0e9-0308-4d2c-be4b-e5679f5e5ab2")
	)
	(text "Mounting centers from PCB top-left (mm):\nSCREW1:  X 3.0615   Y 69.9635   drill 2.20 NPTH\nSCREW2:  X 11.5730   Y 34.3608   drill 2.20 NPTH\nSCREW4:  X 45.8365   Y 34.7870   drill 2.20 NPTH\nSCREW5:  X 10.8085   Y 3.7485   drill 2.20 NPTH\n\nUSB-C footprint extends 1.22 mm beyond bottom edge.\nHeadphone footprint extends 2.19 mm beyond bottom edge.\nConfirm connector STEP / datasheet dimensions before enclosure tooling."
